
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetParcelDetails(Position: vector, ParcelDetails: {number}): {any}`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`list llGetParcelDetails(vector Position, list ParcelDetails);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a list that is the parcel details specified in <b>params</b> (in the same order) for the parcel at <b>pos</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>vector</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>vector</span></td>
          <td>Position / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/pos" target="_blank">pos</a></td>
          <td>only x and y are important and to be given in <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#Region" target="_blank">region coordinates</a></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>{`{number}`}</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>list</span></td>
          <td>ParcelDetails / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/params" target="_blank">params</a></td>
          <td>a list of PARCEL_DETAILS_* flags.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>parcel</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">327</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>Both <b>x</b> and <b>y</b> components of <b>pos</b> are clamped to the range [0.0, 256.0], the <b>z</b> component is ignored.</p>
